om"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Histology</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Relative risk</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>95&#x00025; confidence interval<sup>a</sup></bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic>-value<sup>b</sup></bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Tumour/BPH</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.45</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.88&#x02013;6.35</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.0001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Tumour/non-neoplastic parenchyma</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.83</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.32&#x02013;2.55</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.0002</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Non-neoplastic parenchyma/BPH</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.53</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.81&#x02013;2.91</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.2138</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t4-fn1"><label/><p>BPH=benign prostatic hyperplasia; HO-1=haeme oxygenase-1.</p></fn><fn id="t4-fn2"><label>a</label><p>With Katz's approximation.</p></fn><fn id="t4-fn3"><label>b</label><p>Fisher's exact test.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>